[01:23.11]
[01:29.39]This is the world you've created
{"这是你亲手铸造的世界"}
[01:34.20]The product of what I've become
{"我蜕变的残酷产物"}
[01:37.91]My soul and my youth
{"我的灵魂与青春"}
[01:41.16]Seems it's all for you to use
{"仿佛一切都任你摆布"}
[01:44.35]If I could take back the moment
